Wizmode suggests that star vampires cannot be commanded with the 
spell. Undead turning doesn't affect 'em, either. They can be 
genocided, though. Vecna, of course, cannot be commanded, turned, 
or geno'ed. He is afraid of the Word of the Day, and scary scrolls.

I treat Vecna like I would a demon prince. Stand on the upstairs, 
on something that he finds scary, and smack him with 
whatever ya got. Be sure you're ready to deal with hordes of 
monsters, and have magic resistance and, ideally, the usual 
intrinsics. Meanwhile, you're probably gonna have to descend 
until you have the tools for the job.

I'd suggest that you're being overambitious with conducts. If
you don't know how to deal with a relatively minor boss-type like
Veccers, perhaps you should go ahead and blow some of them.

